IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `spr-part4-qualifying-years`

-- Tests for Part 4 (regulation 13). Expected values are written from lines 142 and 143: the minimum is ten.

§ `Part 4`

#ASSERT `the minimum number of qualifying years for a state pension payable at the reduced rate` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `the minimum number of qualifying years for a state pension payable at the transitional rate` EQUALS 10
-- Either side of ten.
#ASSERT NOT (`the person has the minimum number of qualifying years for the reduced rate` 9)
#ASSERT `the person has the minimum number of qualifying years for the reduced rate` 10
#ASSERT `the person has the minimum number of qualifying years for the reduced rate` 35
#ASSERT NOT (`the person has the minimum number of qualifying years for the reduced rate` 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`the person has the minimum number of qualifying years for the transitional rate` 9)
#ASSERT `the person has the minimum number of qualifying years for the transitional rate` 10
#ASSERT `the person has the minimum number of qualifying years for the transitional rate` 11
